{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n今晚《愛．回家之三代同糖》劇情迎來衝擊性發展！劇中何依婷飾演的朱圓圓才剛榮升暫代客戶總監，公司竟突然空降一位「超齡實習生」龔喜（樊亦敏飾），令所有同事當場集體「O嘴」，場面極度尷尬。更離奇的是，龔喜在見客途中突然腰痛兼頻生意外，搞到何依婷要狼狽地為她「執手尾」，究竟這位神秘實習生是何方神聖？\n</p>\n<h2>今晚劇情大暴走 樊亦敏空降做Intern嚇窒何依婷</h2>\n<p>在今晚（9日）播出的最新一集中，朱圓圓（何依婷飾）的事業迎來小高峰，正當她準備大展拳腳之際，由樊亦敏飾演的龔喜卻在毫無預警下以實習生身份現身「跨世代」，讓眾人措手不及。隨後，圓圓無奈帶着這位「超齡實習生」外出見客，沒想到龔喜途中狀況百出，先是突然腰痛，繼而頻生各種「意外」，令圓圓疲於奔命，全程為她處理爛攤子。面對種種不尋常的舉動，圓圓開始覺得事有可疑，決定暗中對龔喜的背景展開深入調查。</p>\n<h2>龔喜KC身份成謎 網民化身偵探競猜係咪落難富豪</h2>\n<p>自從龔喜與朱基 KC（歐瑞偉飾）登場以來，兩人的「謎之身份」一直是網民熱烈討論的焦點，為劇情增添不少懸念。雖然不少觀眾猜測龔喜極有可能是隱藏的富豪家族成員，但亦有心思細密的網民發揮偵探頭腦，分析指她若是富豪，絕不會屈就於普通大廈。種種線索似乎都指向一個驚人可能性，就是龔喜的真實身份並非表面般簡單，其背後可能隱藏著不為人知的驚天秘密，而這一切謎底將於今晚正式揭曉。</p>\n<h2>網民熱議龔喜真實身份：「被迫離開家族先搬入民居」</h2>\n<p>隨著劇情推展，網民對龔喜身份的猜測已進入白熱化階段，討論區被相關話題洗版。有網民大膽推測：「可能係落難富豪，點會唔住豪宅走去住普通大廈」、「佢根本係被迫離開家族先搬入民居，要靠 KC 做斜槓族賺錢養家！」亦有留言表示：「感覺佢同KC關係唔簡單，可能係為咗避仇家！」、「今晚終於揭曉，等咗好耐！」，所有觀眾都對今晚的劇情發展表示極度期待。</p>\n<p> </p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/09_1371592796af1458dd57d4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/09_1371592796af1458dd57d4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_10049544006af14591704ad.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_10049544006af14591704ad.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_15646098906af145946b03d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_15646098906af145946b03d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/12_16746970846af145978fe1e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/12_16746970846af145978fe1e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/13_14994060456af1459a9cd9a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/13_14994060456af1459a9cd9a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_6799661236af1459e1e4c7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_6799661236af1459e1e4c7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_18193552426af145a0e9a98.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_18193552426af145a0e9a98.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_15149167056af145a3ce420.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_15149167056af145a3ce420.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T11:02:20.083461+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1070,"images":8,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T10:30:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T11:16:34.954649+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T10:56:19.822677+00:00","content_hash":"3232feae42393aae9a1107027dcbf9c77cd51dc59bcb23148926d33c3cfc9e93","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}